          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>Both $\\sigma$ are known, so use the two-sample $z$-test: $z_0 = \\frac{\\bar{x}_1-\\bar{x}_2}{\\sqrt{\\sigma_1^2/n_1 + \\sigma_2^2/n_2}} = \\frac{0.2}{\\sqrt{\\frac{0.576^2}{20}+\\frac{0.776^2}{17}}} = \\frac{0.2}{\\sqrt{0.016589+0.035422}} = \\frac{0.2}{0.22806} = 0.877 \\approx 0.88$. The test of &#39;same weight&#39; is two-sided, so P-value $= 2\\left[1-P(Z<0.88)\\right] = 2(1-0.810) = 0.38$.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Cả hai $\\sigma$ đều biết nên dùng kiểm định $z$ hai mẫu: $z_0 = \\frac{\\bar{x}_1-\\bar{x}_2}{\\sqrt{\\sigma_1^2/n_1 + \\sigma_2^2/n_2}} = \\frac{0{,}2}{\\sqrt{\\frac{0{,}576^2}{20}+\\frac{0{,}776^2}{17}}} = \\frac{0{,}2}{\\sqrt{0{,}016589+0{,}035422}} = \\frac{0{,}2}{0{,}22806} = 0{,}877 \\approx 0{,}88$. Giả thuyết &#39;cùng cân nặng&#39; là hai phía nên P-value $= 2\\left[1-P(Z<0{,}88)\\right] = 2(1-0{,}810) = 0{,}38$.</p></div>"
